# Security Policy:
# 1. All remediable CVEs must be patched directly in code / pom.xml dependency management.
# 2. Transitive dependencies requiring upstream future major versions (e.g. Spring 7.x
#    incompatible with Spring Boot 3) are mitigated by perimeter defense, Zero-Trust JWT,
#    and declarative API boundaries.
# ==============================================================================

