# --- ARCHITECTURAL MITIGATIONS (UPSTREAM SPRING 7.X MAJOR VERSION EXEMPTIONS) ---

# CVE-2026-22732: Spring Security Web - Path matching authorization bypass
# Upstream fixed version: 6.5.9, 7.0.4.
# Mitigation: Microservices enforce Zero-Trust JWT authentication via custom JwtAuthFilter /
# API Gateway filter, extracting cryptographically signed claims prior to standard endpoint matching.
CVE-2026-22732

# CVE-2026-47884: Spring Framework WebMVC - Header predicate bypass in functional endpoints
# Upstream fixed version: 7.0.9.
# Mitigation: The platform strictly uses standard declarative @RestController / @RequestMapping
# controllers; no WebFlux functional router functions or vulnerable predicate chains are exposed.
CVE-2026-47884

# CVE-2026-47892: Spring Framework WebFlux - CORS pre-flight header predicate bypass
# Upstream fixed version: 7.0.9.
# Mitigation: API Gateway routes are statically defined via Spring Cloud Gateway configuration.
# No functional WebFlux routes or header-based functional predicates are utilized.
CVE-2026-47892
